<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the Everyday Decision Tools privacy policy and learn how this static website handles information.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container narrow"><div class="eyebrow">The details</div><h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1><p class="lead">Last updated: November 3, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><article class="container narrow prose"><p>Everyday Decision Tools is designed to provide useful calculators with minimal data collection. This policy explains what information may be processed when you visit the website.</p><h2>Calculator information</h2><p>Calculator inputs and calculations run locally in your browser. The site does not send calculator values to a server, and it does not require an account or login. Avoid entering sensitive personal information into any calculator.</p><h2>Server and hosting data</h2><p>Our hosting provider may automatically process basic technical information, such as IP address, browser type, requested pages, and timestamps, in server logs for security, reliability, and operational purposes. The exact data retained depends on the hosting provider’s policies.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site does not require cookies for calculator functionality and does not include third-party analytics by default. If analytics, advertising, or other third-party services are added later, this policy should be updated to explain those services and their choices.</p><h2>Third-party links</h2><p>Pages may link to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites. Review their policies before sharing information with them.</p><h2>Children’s privacy</h2><p>This website is intended for a general audience and is not designed to knowingly collect personal information from children.</p><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may update this policy as the website changes. The date at the top of this page indicates when it was most recently revised.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@everydaydecisiontools.com">hello@everydaydecisiontools.com</a>.</p><p class="small-print">Before launch, review this policy against your actual hosting, analytics, advertising, and email configuration. It is general website information, not legal advice.</p></article></section>
